{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "In 20 years, you would give everything to be where you are right now. At this age, in this body, living this exact life.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000001"}, {"quote": "You might miss your current age, your health, your body, the people around you and even the problems that now feel so important.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000001"}], "text": "In 20 years, you might miss your current age, health, body, the people around you, and even the problems that feel important now."}, "title": "Life perspective", "topic": "life perspective"}, "content_hash": "1bd1102e07336dc022023d0d892fe32c6d9b5eebd4a6b89f65bd2aabb2278d65", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:knowledge:71c226b6f9c856d3", "metadata_hash": "7644025161b48ec84e07be734d031767913a8804467e6d12f2b2db288559cdf9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-13T04:45:01.434000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "565eafd70d9cb847b47d9a9aee314cc952fd96476880b48ca81becf08b7aa488", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_gratitude-personalgrowth-lifelessons-activity-7482293989656854528-JAkf", "title": "Life perspective", "topic": "life perspective", "topic_slug": "life-perspective"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "How much would I pay to return to my life 20 years ago, when I was 26? Or even 10 years ago, when I was 36? Honestly? Nothing.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000001"}], "text": "The author does not wish to return to their life 10 or 20 years ago because they value their current life stage and experiences."}, "title": "Value of current life stage", "topic": "life reflection"}, "content_hash": "1bd1102e07336dc022023d0d892fe32c6d9b5eebd4a6b89f65bd2aabb2278d65", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:knowledge:f3456cfb1398e664", "metadata_hash": "7644025161b48ec84e07be734d031767913a8804467e6d12f2b2db288559cdf9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-13T04:45:01.434000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "565eafd70d9cb847b47d9a9aee314cc952fd96476880b48ca81becf08b7aa488", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_gratitude-personalgrowth-lifelessons-activity-7482293989656854528-JAkf", "title": "Value of current life stage", "topic": "life reflection", "topic_slug": "life-reflection"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "But gratitude is not about pretending that everything is perfect. Sometimes it is simply recognising that the life you may miss one day is already happening right now.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000002"}], "text": "Gratitude is not about pretending everything is perfect, but recognizing that the life you might miss one day is happening now."}, "title": "Gratitude and appreciation", "topic": "gratitude"}, "content_hash": "1bd1102e07336dc022023d0d892fe32c6d9b5eebd4a6b89f65bd2aabb2278d65", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:knowledge:36c98daa1f443b48", "metadata_hash": "7644025161b48ec84e07be734d031767913a8804467e6d12f2b2db288559cdf9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-13T04:45:01.434000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "565eafd70d9cb847b47d9a9aee314cc952fd96476880b48ca81becf08b7aa488", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_gratitude-personalgrowth-lifelessons-activity-7482293989656854528-JAkf", "title": "Gratitude and appreciation", "topic": "gratitude", "topic_slug": "gratitude"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000001", "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000002"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "Would you go back 10 or 20 years if you could?", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000002"}], "text": "Would you go back 10 or 20 years if you could?"}, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": {"citations": [{"quote": "How much would I pay to return to my life 20 years ago, when I was 26? Or even 10 years ago, when I was 36? Honestly? Nothing.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000001"}], "text": "The author values their current life and wouldn't pay to return to their past self 10 or 20 years ago."}, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Jimmy Carr shared this thought on The Diary of a CEO, and it genuinely stayed with me.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:u000001"}], "text": "The author reflects on a thought shared by Jimmy Carr about valuing one's current life stage."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Reflecting on life experiences", "topic": "life reflection"}, "content_hash": "1bd1102e07336dc022023d0d892fe32c6d9b5eebd4a6b89f65bd2aabb2278d65", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc:cases:f0c282db799376e7", "metadata_hash": "7644025161b48ec84e07be734d031767913a8804467e6d12f2b2db288559cdf9", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-07-13T04:45:01.434000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "565eafd70d9cb847b47d9a9aee314cc952fd96476880b48ca81becf08b7aa488", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-07-13-in-20-years-you-would-md-07336225bc", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/pos